        "created_at": "2012-06-03T20:49:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Tame? I beg to differ.</p>\n<p>… I forgot to mention Demoralize, didn’t I.</p>\n<p>Anyway, she spits out a bunch of birds, who all instantly die. Then she hits AZ for a bunch of fire damage (2-3 per bird; more if Huninn and Muginn are out) which he then uses to hit her back (5-6, depending on buffs) and heal himself. Then on his turn, he uses Coolant Blast for an easy 25+ damage. Plus any oneshots or impales he has out.</p>\n<p>You say tame, I say borderline game-breaking.</p>",
